@startuml 10_顺序图_控制机器人
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #2E6DA4
  ArrowFontSize 15
  LifeLineBorderColor #9DB8D2
  ParticipantBorderColor #2E6DA4
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF3FB
  ParticipantFontSize 15
}
actor "家属" as F
participant "家属端 App" as APP
participant "看护平台服务端" as SRV
database "绑定关系库" as DB
participant "机器人终端" as ROB

F -> APP : 打开控制面板
APP -> SRV : 申请控制权
SRV -> DB : 校验家属与老人绑定关系
DB --> SRV : 绑定有效
SRV --> APP : 下发控制令牌
F -> APP : 选择“自主跟随”
APP -> SRV : 提交指令 模式=跟随
SRV -> ROB : 转发控制指令
ROB -> ROB : 启动视觉跟随
ROB --> SRV : 指令执行结果
SRV --> APP : 状态回显
APP --> F : 面板显示跟随中
@enduml
